I find that when I look in my bag of holding or go to take things out,
they are separated *in* the bag if they were put in separated but if
the same alignment, etc. will wind up in the same inventory
letter/space when taken out.  I often find myself doing that (taking
things out to then group them together to put them back in, similar to
your drop and pick up method) so that my bag content list isn't a dozen
pages long when it could be contained on a page and half.

